      "section": "Copy number",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Top to bottom: nMajor (red) and nMinor (green) per called segment, the log2 ratio of each 20 kb bin under segments coloured gain, neutral or loss, and the B-allele frequency with mirrored segment bands. On chr3 log2 stays flat while nMinor drops to 0 and the BAF splits, a copy-neutral LOH only the allele-specific tracks show. Scroll to zoom, shift-drag to brush a region, switch sample or view in the header; inputs come from nf-core/sarek (ASCAT, Control-FREEC, CNVkit), and the hg38 gene lane is only an orientation aid on this synthetic genome.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
    },
